{"type":"message","id":"57f25ed0","parentId":"ec069ec4","timestamp":"2026-05-17T16:16:27.270Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the health endpoint works and returns \"OK\". The root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" but that's expected. The /send endpoint is returning 1101 - this could be an issue with the backend service itself.\n\nLet me try the send endpoint one more time with a minimal payload to see if we get a different error or if it works.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c63f780b-effd-4489-992f-251f960acff1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 16:15 UTC test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18216,"output":167,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18495,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779034580598,"responseId":"chatcmpl-15703456-53d4-4072-b09a-659766002cd5"}}
