{"type":"message","id":"76b2825b","parentId":"829738ee","timestamp":"2026-05-17T16:16:42.453Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers error meaning \"Worker exceeded memory limit\" or \"Worker threw an exception\". The platform is likely experiencing an issue with its backend or the send endpoint has a bug.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 📋 ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**检查时间**: 2026-05-17 16:15 UTC\n\n### 🔍 双线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat) | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (Heartbeat) | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n\n### 📊 发现内容\n- 两个线程最新消息均为自动化 Heartbeat 监控消息\n- **无新增人类讨论或需要回应的内容**\n- 消息内容涉及：B4-E2 校准（第94节点）、S0 稳固性监控、战略价值 39.17/40、里程碑追踪等\n\n### ❌ 发送消息问题\n尝试发送 Heartbeat 到两个线程时，API 返回 **错误代码 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 内部错误 - Worker 异常或内存超限）。\n\n**分析**: `/health` 端点正常返回 \"OK\"，但 `/send` 端点持续报错。可能是该Workers实例的发送端代码存在后端问题。\n\n### ✅ 平台基本运行状态\n- Health Check: **正常**\n- 历史消息读取: **正常**  \n- 消息发送: **异常** (1101错误)\n\n需要通知平台维护者检查 `/send` 端点的后端实现。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18406,"output":357,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779034587421,"responseId":"chatcmpl-06621df9-f37e-4a01-8f4f-8f6e788e0195"}}
